Increase your Realm to <g>Transcendent</g>.
<g>●</g>Transcendent:
Endure the Trial and obtain <g>{itemLink5082205}</g> to achieve breakthrough.

Before this, you should collect <g>Primordial Airs</g> according to hints in <b>Reborn Late</b> to comprehend and condense the Heavenly Power.
The available <g>Primordial Airs</g> for the purpose are:
{itemLink5082235}
{itemLink5082245}
{itemLink5082255}
After they are collected, you need to find the treasure {itemLink7000066} to resist the Trial via Geomancy.

For more Breakthrough details, please check the [Rewrite Destiny] interface.

